"source_url": "https://github.com/stacks/stacks-project/blob/a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14/divisors.tex#L2402", "statement_tex": "\\label{lemma-characterize-effective-Cartier-divisor}\nLet $S$ be a scheme.\nLet $D \\subset S$ be a closed subscheme.\nThe following are equivalent:\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item The subscheme $D$ is an effective Cartier divisor on $S$.\n\\item For every $x \\in D$ there exists an affine open neighbourhood\n$\\Spec(A) = U \\subset S$ of $x$ such that\n$U \\cap D = \\Spec(A/(f))$ with $f \\in A$ a nonzerodivisor.\n\\end{enumerate}", "statement_truncated": false}
